				<guid>http://localhost:1313/contact/</guid>
				<description>&lt;section class=&#34;contact-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3&gt;Questions?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Do you have a question about the wedding? Email us at &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:stef.laz.wedding@gmail.com&#34;&gt;stef.laz.wedding@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;contact-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3&gt;Share your photos&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you take photos at the venue, we’d love to see them. We won’t share them; we’ll keep them as memories of this special day.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;pending-link&#34;&gt;Upload link coming soon&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;story-photo&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/StefLazCouch.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Stef and Laz relaxing together on a couch&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;</description>
