			<item>
				<title>Discover Budapest</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/sightseeing/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/sightseeing/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;If you have time to explore Budapest while you’re here for our wedding, these favourite sights are a wonderful place to start:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;attraction-grid&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/parliament.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The Hungarian Parliament reflected in the Danube&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.parlament.hu/en/web/visitors&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Hungarian Parliament Building&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;A striking Gothic Revival landmark on the banks of the Danube.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/fishermans-bastion-pinterest.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Fisherman&amp;#39;s Bastion overlooking the Danube and Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Buda Castle &amp;amp; Fisherman&amp;#39;s Bastion&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Climb Castle Hill for sweeping views across the city.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/szechenyi-baths.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The outdoor pools at Széchenyi Thermal Bath&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.szechenyibath.hu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Széchenyi Thermal Bath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Unwind in Budapest&amp;#39;s famous thermal waters before the celebration.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/veli-bej-budapestinfo.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Interior of Veli Bej Thermal Bath in Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.irgalmasrend.hu/site/velibej/home&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Veli Bej Thermal Bath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Step into a restored 16th-century Ottoman bath in the historic Császár complex.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/rudas-baths.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The domed interior pool at Rudas Thermal Bath&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.rudasfurdo.hu/en/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Rudas Thermal Bath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Discover a historic Ottoman bath known for its domed pool and Danube views.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/szimpla-kert.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The colorful courtyard and interior of Szimpla Kert&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://szimpla.eu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Szimpla Kert Ruin Bar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Explore Budapest&amp;#39;s iconic ruin bar, known for its eclectic rooms, courtyard and lively atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/grandio-jungle-bar.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Garden courtyard at Grandio Jungle Grill Bar&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://pubcrawlbudapest.hu/ruin-bars/grandio.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Grandio Ruin Bar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;A leafy courtyard bar with relaxed garden seating, food and evening music.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/hungarian-national-museum.png&#34; alt=&#34;Aerial view of the Hungarian National Museum&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://mnm.hu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Hungarian National Museum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Discover Hungarian history and culture in a landmark neoclassical museum.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/museum-of-fine-arts.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The neoclassical Museum of Fine Arts in Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.mfab.hu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Museum of Fine Arts Budapest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;See European and Hungarian masterpieces beside Heroes&amp;#39; Square.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Gifts</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/gifts/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/gifts/</guid>
				<description>&lt;section class=&#34;contact-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Having you celebrate with us is truly the greatest gift of all. Because we live outside Budapest and split our time between three countries, travelling with physical gifts is quite tricky for us!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you would still like to honour us with a gift, a contribution toward our next chapter - finishing our new flat and planning a relaxing honeymoon - would be wonderful.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Further details will be included with your RSVP form.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
