ction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/hotel-meininger-budapest.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Guest room at MEININGER Budapest Great Market Hall&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.meininger-hotels.com/en/hotels/budapest/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;MEININGER Budapest Great Market Hall&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/hotel-charles.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Photo of Hotel Charles&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.charleshotel.hu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Hotel Charles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/hotel-dormero.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Photo of DORMERO Hotel Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.dormero.de/hotel-budapest/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;DORMERO Hotel Budapest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/hotel-exe-budapest.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Photo of Exe Budapest Center&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.eurostarshotels.com/exe-budapest-center.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Exe Budapest Center&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
