				<guid>http://localhost:1313/photo-credits/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;We are grateful to the photographers and sources whose images help us share Budapest with our guests.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungarian Parliament Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Photo by Pierre Blaché, dedicated to the public domain under CC0. &lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hungarian_Parliament_Building_2023-9.jpg&#34;&gt;View the image and details on Wikimedia Commons&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fisherman&amp;rsquo;s Bastion:&lt;/strong&gt; Image from the Pinterest pin supplied for this site. &lt;a href=&#34;https://ph.pinterest.com/pin/641059328208145770/&#34;&gt;View the pin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Széchenyi Thermal Bath:&lt;/strong&gt; Image from the &lt;a href=&#34;https://szechenyibath.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/Szechenyi-Spa-Baths-Press-Photo-Outdoor-Pool.jpg&#34;&gt;Széchenyi Bath press photo&lt;/a&gt;; usage license not stated.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veli Bej:&lt;/strong&gt; Image via BudapestInfo. &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.budapestinfo.hu/storage/og-images/NbZtAOtS7Gf5a3A61nhBOTjgYRVIHIPq6fsZJ9KV.jpg&#34;&gt;View the source image&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rudas Baths:&lt;/strong&gt; Image from a Bing Images link supplied by the couple; original author and license are not identified.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Szimpla Kert:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://image.stern.de/33776650/t/kY/v2/w1440/r1.7778/-/budapest-szimpla-kert.jpg&#34;&gt;Stern&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grandio Jungle Grill Bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nomadicmick.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Ruin-Bars-Budapest-Grandio-Jungle-Grill-Bar-Hostel.jpg&#34;&gt;Nomadic Mick&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungarian National Museum:&lt;/strong&gt; Image from the museum ticket site; &lt;a href=&#34;https://mnm.hu/&#34;&gt;official museum website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Museum of Fine Arts Budapest:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.knykk.hu/hirek/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Ahol-a-mult-talalkozik-a-jovovel-uj-kiallitasok-a-2048x1155.jpg&#34;&gt;KNYKK&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.mfab.hu/&#34;&gt;official museum website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Szimpla Kert:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://image.stern.de/33776650/t/kY/v2/w1440/r1.7778/-/budapest-szimpla-kert.jpg&#34;&gt;Stern&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grandio Jungle Grill Bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nomadicmick.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Ruin-Bars-Budapest-Grandio-Jungle-Grill-Bar-Hostel.jpg&#34;&gt;Nomadic Mick&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungarian National Museum:&lt;/strong&gt; Image from the ticket site; &lt;a href=&#34;https://mnm.hu/&#34;&gt;official museum website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Museum of Fine Arts:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.knykk.hu/hirek/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Ahol-a-mult-talalkozik-a-jovovel-uj-kiallitasok-a-2048x1155.jpg&#34;&gt;KNYKK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
